est ballistic missile launch comes amid rising border tensions with South Korea and uncertainty over potential nuclear talks with the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: Department of Homeland Security data leak exposes details of more than 40,000 employees</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4c1536a625938cfb1f836d0cb8cd88dc6814661f9aee90cd615d691cc833987c</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:03:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T03:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-department-of-homeland-security-data-leak-exposes-details-of-more-than-40-000-employees/a-79791765--d74f0832e8f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-department-of-homeland-security-data-leak-exposes-details-of-more-than-40-000-employees/a-79791765?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The leaked information reportedly includes names, phone numbers and email addresses of personnel across several US security agencies. This follows recent data breaches involving the FBI and the Defense Department.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU countries block Canada's 'associate membership' plan</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a083c61d71cc0787562abfb60511f2fc69e586ab05dbc1d2d0b5455204315c00</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:03:14Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T00:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-countries-block-canada-s-associate-membership-plan/a-79791601--4f2239f5da99.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-countries-block-canada-s-associate-membership-plan/a-79791601?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European Commission President Ursula von der Leyen wanted to give Canada a special status within the EU. But Germany and other member states have raised objections ahead of a summit in Montreal.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Flavio Bolsonaro lands in US, declares himself 'leader' of Brazil</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3bd1348dee84865d5a80693b41a7539dec3048039106a9d3a5035a04469c4491</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:03:17Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T22:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/flavio-bolsonaro-lands-in-us-declares-himself-leader-of-brazil/a-79788659--e413c3c7c69a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/flavio-bolsonaro-lands-in-us-declares-himself-leader-of-brazil/a-79788659?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Flavio Bolsonaro declared himself the rightful leader of his country despite losing the presidential election runoff on Sunday. He and his family have fled to the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How do the US midterms work, and why are they so important for Trump's presidency?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3cbbd5a97c13ba3eb44728408f02dafaf9740bd2135d565b83f6747e7a6104ef</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:07Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T19:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-do-the-us-midterms-work-and-why-are-they-so-important-for-trump-s-presidency/a-79789932--5c980e8318e2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-do-the-us-midterms-work-and-why-are-they-so-important-for-trump-s-presidency/a-79789932?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US voters are electing a new Congress. The results will be decisive for the future of the United States, and a judgment on Donald Trump's second term as president.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Evacuation from Oleshky: How are preparations going?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:822c630e409505eb879f43657a09963bb15b6157719ed1662876d659fe85ca73</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:07Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T17:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/evacuation-from-oleshky-how-are-preparations-going/a-79790001--e77f75613f06.html" type="te